    "Sources are remote blocklists you subscribe to, like StevenBlack. Toggle them per profile and refresh to pull updates. You can add your own source by URL — it must be https, and its contents are verified by checksum before use.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sources are remote blocklists you subscribe to, like StevenBlack. Toggle them per profile and refresh to pull updates. You can add your own source by URL — it must be https, and its contents are verified by checksum before use."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sources are remote blocklists you subscribe to, like StevenBlack. Toggle them per profile and refresh to pull updates. You can add your own source by URL — it must be https, and its contents are verified by checksum before use."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Las fuentes son listas de bloqueo remotas a las que te suscribes, como StevenBlack. Actívalas en cada perfil y actualiza para descargar los cambios. Puedes añadir tu propia fuente por URL: debe ser https y su contenido se verifica por suma de comprobación antes de usarlo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Les sources sont des listes de blocage distantes auxquelles vous vous abonnez, comme StevenBlack. Activez-les profil par profil et actualisez pour récupérer les mises à jour. Vous pouvez ajouter votre propre source par URL : elle doit être en https, et son contenu est vérifié par somme de contrôle avant utilisation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Subscribe to a hosts-format list. The address must be a secure https URL.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Subscribe to a hosts-format list. The address must be a secure https URL."
