            "value": "Suscríbete a una lista con formato hosts. La dirección debe ser una URL https segura."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Abonnez-vous à une liste au format hosts. L’adresse doit être une URL https sécurisée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch profiles, refresh sources, or open the window from the menu-bar icon. In Settings you can set the auto-refresh interval, re-apply the active profile automatically after a refresh, show the active profile's name in the menu bar, and launch Hosts Switchr at login.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch profiles, refresh sources, or open the window from the menu-bar icon. In Settings you can set the auto-refresh interval, re-apply the active profile automatically after a refresh, show the active profile's name in the menu bar, and launch Hosts Switchr at login."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch profiles, refresh sources, or open the window from the menu-bar icon. In Settings you can set the auto-refresh interval, re-apply the active profile automatically after a refresh, show the active profile's name in the menu bar, and launch Hosts Switchr at login."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Cambia de perfil, actualiza las fuentes o abre la ventana desde el icono de la barra de menús. En Ajustes puedes definir el intervalo de actualización automática, volver a aplicar el perfil activo automáticamente tras una actualización, mostrar el nombre del perfil activo en la barra de menús y abrir Hosts Switchr al iniciar sesión."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Changez de profil, actualisez les sources ou ouvrez la fenêtre depuis l’icône de la barre des menus. Dans les Réglages, vous pouvez définir l’intervalle d’actualisation automatique, réappliquer le profil actif automatiquement après une actualisation, afficher le nom du profil actif dans la barre des menus et ouvrir Hosts Switchr à l’ouverture de session."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That address isn’t secure (https). Sources are added over https only — their contents are written into your system hosts file, and a plain-http link could be tampered with on the way to you. Try the https:// version of the address; most lists offer one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That address isn’t secure (https). Sources are added over https only — their contents are written into your system hosts file, and a plain-http link could be tampered with on the way to you. Try the https:// version of the address; most lists offer one."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That address isn’t secure (https). Sources are added over https only — their contents are written into your system hosts file, and a plain-http link could be tampered with on the way to you. Try the https:// version of the address; most lists offer one."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Esa dirección no es segura (https). Las fuentes solo se añaden por https: su contenido se escribe en el archivo hosts del sistema y un enlace http sin cifrar podría manipularse por el camino. Prueba con la versión https:// de la dirección; la mayoría de listas ofrecen una."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Cette adresse n’est pas sécurisée (https). Les sources ne sont ajoutées qu’en https : leur contenu est écrit dans le fichier hosts de votre système, et un lien en http simple pourrait être altéré en chemin. Essayez la version https:// de l’adresse ; la plupart des listes en proposent une."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That address redirected to an insecure (http) location, so it was blocked.": {
